value":"quest3s","up":"quest3","why":"{t} supports VR. The Quest 3S is the cheapest way into PC VR over Air Link or a cable; the Quest 3 adds sharper pancake lenses.","icon":"vr"},"hotas":{"label":"Flight stick and throttle","value":"hotas","up":null,"why":"A stick and throttle makes flying in {t} feel like a cockpit instead of a keyboard. The HOTAS One works on PC and Xbox.","icon":"joystick"},"wheel":{"label":"Racing wheel","value":"g29","up":"g923","why":"A force-feedback wheel and pedals give real throttle and brake control in {t}. The G29 is the best-value wheel; the G923 adds smoother TrueForce feedback.","icon":"wheel"},"fps_mouse":{"label":"Low-latency mouse","value":"g305","up":"superlight2","why":"Fast aim in {t} needs a light mouse with a quick wireless link. The G305 is a cheap lag-free wireless pick; the Superlight 2 is what pros use.","icon":"mouse"},"comp_kb":{"label":"Fast keyboard","value":"aulaf75","up":"huntsman","why":"Quick, consistent keys for movement in {t}. The Huntsman V3 Pro adds rapid-trigger switches that reset the moment you let go.","icon":"keyboard"},"comp_monitor":{"label":"High-refresh monitor","value":"sansui","up":"lg27gr75q","why":"Higher refresh means smoother motion and quicker reactions in {t}. Both are sharp 1440p screens at 165Hz or more for the price of a 1080p monitor.","icon":"monitor"},"comp_headset":{"label":"Headset with a clear mic","value":"blackshark","up":"cloud3","why":"Hear footsteps and give callouts in {t}. The BlackShark V2 X is a light budget headset with a mic teammates can hear; the Cloud III is a step up in comfort and sound.","icon":"headset"},"chat_headset":{"label":"Headset for co-op voice chat","value":"cloud3","up":"g733","why":"{t} is better with friends on voice. The Cloud III has a clear detachable mic; the G733 goes wireless for long co-op nights.","icon":"headset"},"mic":{"label":"Microphone","value":"am8","up":"quadcast","why":"For crisp voice chat or streaming {t}, a desk mic beats any headset mic. The AM8 is a great USB starter; the QuadCast S is the creator favorite.","icon":"mic"},"controller":{"label":"Controller","value":"8bitdo2c","up":"8bitdo2","why":"{t} plays great on a controller. The 8BitDo Ultimate 2C is a cheap, reliable PC pad; the Ultimate 2 adds drift-free Hall effect sticks and a charging dock.","icon":"controller"},"sports_pad":{"label":"Controller","value":"xboxpad","up":"dsedge","why":"Sports games like {t} are built around a controller. The Xbox pad works on PC with no setup; the DualSense Edge adds back buttons and swappable sticks.","icon":"controller"},"big_monitor":{"label":"Monitor for the best visuals","value":"sansui","up":"odyssey","why":"Show off {t} on a sharp 1440p screen. The SANSUI is the budget pick; the 32-inch curved Odyssey wraps the picture around you.","icon":"monitor"},"detail_monitor":{"label":"Monitor with room for maps and menus","value":"dellqhd","up":"odyssey","why":"1440p gives {t} far more screen space for maps, menus and UI than 1080p.","icon":"monitor"},"strat_mouse":{"label":"Mouse with extra buttons","value":"g502hero","up":"g502wl","why":"Bind hotkeys to side buttons and spend long sessions in {t} comfortably. The G502 is the classic; the Lightspeed version cuts the cord.","icon":"mouse"},"type_kb":{"label":"Keyboard","value":"g413","up":"keychron","why":"Lots of hotkeys and typing in {t}. A solid mechanical board makes long sessions easier on your hands.","icon":"keyboard"},"immersive_headset":{"label":"Headset for immersive sound","value":"cloud3","up":"nova7","why":"Atmosphere is half of {t}. The Cloud III has rich spatial sound; the Arctis Nova 7 goes wireless with long battery life.","icon":"headset"},"speakers":{"label":"Speakers","value":"pebble","up":"edifier","why":"Relaxed games like {t} sound great on desk speakers. The Pebble V3 is tiny and cheap; the Edifier G2000 fills the room.","icon":"speaker"},"ambience":{"label":"Room lighting","value":"govee","up":null,"why":"Light bars that sync colors to the screen make the scary parts of {t} hit harder after dark.","icon":"light"},"gpu":{"label":"Graphics card upgrade","value":"rtx5060","up":"rx7800","why":"{t} recommends a strong graphics card. The RTX 5060 is the value upgrade for 1080p with DLSS; the RX 7800 XT handles 1440p at high settings.","icon":"gpu"},"deck_storage":{"label":"Steam Deck storage","value":"sd256","up":"sd512","why":"{t} runs on Steam Deck. A fast microSD card adds room for it and the rest of your library.","icon":"storage"},"chair":{"label":"Chair for long sessions","value":"gtplayer","up":"tc100","why":"{t} is the kind of game you lose hours in. Back support matters.","icon":"chair"},"mousepad":{"label":"Mousepad","value":"qck","up":null,"why":"A big, consistent surface for wide aim sweeps in {t}.","icon":"pad"}},"profiles":{"vr":["vr","immersive_headset","big_monitor"],"flight":["hotas","big_monitor","immersive_headset","type_kb"],"racing":["wheel","big_monitor","controller","immersive_headset"],"competitive":["fps_mouse","comp_monitor","comp_headset","comp_kb","mic","mousepad"],"sports":["sports_pad","comp_monitor","chat_headset","mic"],"coop":["chat_headset","mic","controller","big_monitor"],"horror":["immersive_headset","big_monitor","ambience","controller"],"strategy":["detail_monitor","strat_mouse","type_kb","chair","immersive_headset"],"rpg":["big_monitor","immersive_headset","controller","strat_mouse","chair"],"action":["big_monitor","controller","immersive_headset","fps_mouse"],"shooter":["fps_mouse","comp_monitor","immersive_headset","comp_kb"],"casual":["controller","speakers","big_monitor"],"general":["big_monitor","immersive_headset","controller","strat_mouse","type_kb"]},"keywords":{"vr":"\\bvr\\b|virtual reality|half-life: alyx|beat saber|boneworks|bonelab|superhot vr","flight":"flight|flight sim|ace combat|squadrons|x-plane|\\bdcs\\b|elite dangerous|star citizen|war thunder|il-2|aerofly|pilot|airplane|aircraft","racing":"racing|racer|\\brace\\b|rally|forza|\\bf1\\b|di